WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:42.620
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:46.890
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones</i>

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.830
<i>with their partner Digimon
carried out their mission.</i>

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:57.150
<i>They met the key to saving the world,
the Holy Digimon, Patamon.</i>

00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:59.640
<i>And thus, they fulfilled their one goal.</i>

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.910
<i>And the battle raged
against the crazed Mega Digimon,</i>

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:14.650
<i>Donedevimon, who evolved by absorbing
energy from the confused real world.</i>

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:21.930
<i>Taichi and the others made
frantic efforts and survived,</i>

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:27.450
<i>but destiny took no time in bringing
their next adventure to them.</i>

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.550
Agumon!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.070
You okay?

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:39.680
Taichi...

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:41.840
It's too bad...

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.510
We have no time for a break.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:47.180
The ground...

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.710
DIVE TO THE NEXT OCEAN

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:31.750
<i>All units standby after takeoff in area
Tango, Oscar, Echo, India, Zero, Eight</i>

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:33.250
<i>until further instructions.</i>

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.960
<i>This is not a drill.</i>

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.730
<i>I repeat, this is not a drill.</i>

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:41.360
<i>An update on the tanker collision
in the Strait of Hormuz.</i>

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.300
<i>The White House has announced earlier</i>

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:48.870
<i>that the possibility of this being an act
of terrorism cannot be ruled out.</i>

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:54.330
<i>A scramble was ordered on the U.S.
aircraft carrier off the Bahrain shores.</i>

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:59.860
<i>Due to this, the risk of military conflict
in the Strait of Hormuz has spiked,</i>

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.900
<i>and the tension
between nations are increasing.</i>

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:06.360
Hey, isn't this becoming
a really big problem?!

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.160
I read this somewhere.

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:09.990
Unlike the Strait of Malacca,

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:15.370
there's already military tension between
the U.S. and Iran in the Strait of Hormuz.

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:17.540
An accident there of all places.

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:18.750
Isn't that...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.920
It's more dangerous than before.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:24.420
At this rate,
the accident could possibly lead to war.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:25.280
What?!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:30.300
The Digimon's infiltration of the AIS
is spreading more and more too...

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.850
Hm? PTA?

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.560
AIS!

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:38.290
Only your "A" was correct
and the order's wrong, Mimi-kun.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:44.320
The AIS is a system where ships at sea
uses digital signals emitted from the GPS

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.490
to identify your own location.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:48.410
Oh, really...

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:52.160
Which means the AIS is part
of the network too then.

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:55.200
So the infiltration of the AIS
is getting worse?

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.060
Yes.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:59.820
It's the same phenomenon
as the uncontrollable tanker,

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.090
but on a different level this time!

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:03.240
What?!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.540
Umm...

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:19.500
This is...

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.660
What the heck's going on?

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.650
Weren't we sinking earlier?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.730
Why are we falling through the sky?

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:42.860
Yamato, look!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.340
Can that be... the Cloud Continent?

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:53.140
I think...

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:54.240
Which means...

00:05:55.120 --> 00:06:00.640
The land and sea we've been seeing
this whole time was all on top of that?!

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:05.130
Since we fell from there,
what's gonna happen to us?!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.880
Takeru, are you okay?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.640
Patamon!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.700
Oh, thank you.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.770
You shouldn't carelessly fly out.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.710
Patamon!

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.170
Takeru!

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.940
Hey, Yamato.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:28.950
So, I don't really remember much
after I was gobbled up by Devimon.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.160
But...

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.660
we defeated Devimon, right?

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:36.500
Yeah.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.310
With you and Agumon.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.270
What?!

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:42.170
But...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.420
What happened back there...

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.720
I can't explain it either.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:13.450
That's the Digimon that was carrying
Devimon's castle, right?

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.180
I think Eldoradimon's saying something.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:17.200
Yeah.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.210
Patamon?

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.540
Please see this.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:30.980
The red ones are all uncontrollable ships
from the AIS infiltration.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.490
This many?!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.640
Stopping all of this would be...

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:36.870
<i>Koshiro-san!</i>

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.270
Did you find something?!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.520
Yeah, we found something!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:44.020
No mistake these guys
are the root of the problem!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:51.710
A new enemy!

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:54.160
Now an explosive outbreak of Zurumon!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.490
ZURUMON

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.020
Zurumon... an In-Training Digimon.

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.560
So this is the cause of the problem now?

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.420
Yes.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.170
I've never experienced an attack
of this magnitude.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.180
What do we do?
There's so many it's hopeless!

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:17.530
Give me a minute!
I'll think of a plan immediately!

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.140
<i>We're counting on you!</i>

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.770
Hikari-chan...

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.110
A sea of clouds!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.820
How far are we gonna fall?!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.410
BIGMAMEMON
MAMEMON

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:41.950
What are those?!

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.960
Mamemon! The big ones are Bigmamemon!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.650
What's with these guys?!

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:41.490
They'll blow up anything
that gets close to the swarm!

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.870
Regardless of if they're friend or foe!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.520
One after another...

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.150
My brain can't keep up!

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.170
Taichi... I'm out of energy...

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.150
Agumon!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:55.650
Gabumon!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.760
What's that? Looks like a big balloon!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:03.740
This isn't the time to be impressed!

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.760
Leomon!

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:43.760
You all right?

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:45.550
Yeah! You saved us!

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:47.040
Thank you!

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:52.020
We thought we were heading
for Devimon's castle by following you,

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:53.560
then this happened.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:56.650
To be honest,
I don't know what's going on.

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:58.940
We're on the same page there.

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:02.050
Anyway, we're glad
to be able to reunite with you.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:13.040
That voice is saying "Help"!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.080
You can tell?

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:15.170
Yeah.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:17.780
Isn't that Digimon
one of Devimon's henchmen?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.490
Wait, could that possibly be...

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.280
Eldoradimon?!

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:23.510
Yeah.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:27.550
A Mega Digimon that has been alive
since ancient times.

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:32.100
I heard rumors that Eldoradimon
existed somewhere on Cloud Continent,

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.440
but to think I'd see the real thing...

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:37.820
However, why was such a Digimon
working under Devimon?

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:41.820
Eldoradimon's actually
a really strong Digimon...

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:48.080
<i>but the miasma swamps that emerged across
the continent tainted Eldoradimon's body.</i>

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:51.910
And the weakened Eldoradimon
was taken advantage of by Devimon.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.690
So that's what happened...

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.470
By the way, this is?

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:59.420
Patamon... the Holy Digimon!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:01.200
W-What?!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:07.760
Looks like Eldoradimon can't move well yet
from being bound by miasma for so long.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:10.450
If Eldoradimon falls somewhere
like this...

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.960
I want to help Eldoradimon!

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.460
Thanks to Eldoradimon,
I was able to meet Patamon!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.510
All right, let's do it!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.030
Taichi...

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.720
Taichi-san!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:32.830
Yeah.

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.400
Yamato...

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.500
Will you help us?

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:39.650
Yes... but do you have a plan?

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:42.650
Yeah!

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:44.240
All right!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:46.990
Agumon and Gabumon look exhausted.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:51.160
If anything needs to be done,
we'll carry it out first.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.870
Here we go!

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.150
What's the matter?

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.690
Just wondering what you guys are doing.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:07.700
Umm, that's really hard to explain...

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.740
Was there a good counterplan?

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:11.700
It's still analyzing.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.810
<i>But...</i>

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.190
I'll make sure to solve this problem!

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.690
The ocean!

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:40.920
What do we do?!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.650
If we hit the ocean like this...

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.920
We'll be smithereens!

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:50.260
We gotta make a soft landing!
Just like a malfunctioning plane!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:53.140
Get closer to Eldoradimon!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.500
Leomon!

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:08.010
Can we level Eldoradimon's body somehow?

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.950
I'll try it...
but it'll be a little rough!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.340
Jyuoken!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:47.210
All right!

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.110
The problem is after this!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.720
Taichi, do your best!

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:55.040
Yamato...

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.880
Air Shot!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:23.080
Eldoradimon! Sorry for the pain!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.500
But we promise to land you safely!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.400
Get ready!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.750
I'll take them!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.380
We have too much speed!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:14.280
If we hit the water like this,
we won't survive!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.350
We've dropped speed a bit!

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:30.800
Eldoradimon, keep your head up like that!
You can do it!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:53.360
Leomon!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.010
We still got too much speed!

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:02.750
We gotta soften the impact somehow!

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.630
Yamato! That's it!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:10.210
It's all-or-nothing!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.010
Yamato! Taichi-san!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.520
Agumon!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.020
Gabumon!

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:30.820
Taichi!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.530
Yamato!

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:59.090
Agumon Evolution!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.440
Greymon!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.960
Gabumon Evolution!

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.470
Garurumon!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.750
Greymon!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:50.850
Garurumon!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.330
Taichi!

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.610
Sorry for the wait!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:59.110
Shoot the big ones down to the ocean!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.240
You just have to hit them!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.780
Mega Flame!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.040
Fox Fire!

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:23.950
Yes!

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:24.810
Next!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:35.380
I'm getting the hang of it!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.530
Yeah!

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:41.910
Keep going!

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.600
Just a little more!

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:54.460
Shoot!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.310
I'm so glad!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:01.360
Thanks a bunch, Agumon.

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:06.320
Taichi, I'm hungry...

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.760
We're saved.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:11.330
I'm hungry too...

00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:23.110
I know!

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:23.980
This is it!

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.220
What?

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.570
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.570
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:48.240
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:48.240
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.700
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.700
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:56.290
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:56.290
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.790
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.790
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.170
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:00.170
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.090
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.090
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.260
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:05.260
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:08.340
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:10.640
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:10.640
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.600
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:13.600
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.060
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:19.060
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.320
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:25.240
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:25.240
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:35.750
<i>Atlurkabuterimon.</i>

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:38.250
LEVEL: ULTIMATE

00:22:35.910 --> 00:22:38.250
<i>This Digimon super evolves
from Kabuterimon.</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.090
TYPE: INSECT

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:41.090
<i>The horn's bolder
and the body's more muscular now.</i>

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:43.300
SPECIAL MOVE: HORN BUSTER

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:43.300
<i>The special move is Horn Buster!</i>

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:45.300
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>The body becomes bigger
and more comfy to ride!</i>

00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:50.340
<i>A special cushion is not needed.</i>

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>Although, I do want a tablet mount.
Maybe I'll ask next time?</i>

00:22:57.430 --> 00:22:59.940
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:06.030
<i>Taichi's party is against the odds
in the ocean surrounded by Digimon.</i>

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:08.530
<i>Will they survive this ultimate pinch?!</i>

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:12.320
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Break Through the Sea Monster Barricade"</i>

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:14.910
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
